  "description": "meme-id: who_needs_a_human_interaction; hasOverallIntent: harmful; overall-intent-description: The meme depicts three images of couples in bed, with text suggesting that human interaction is unnecessary because one has a 'loyal animal companion.' This implies that pets can replace human companionship, which can be harmful by promoting the idea that human relationships are less valuable or unnecessary. It may also subtly devalue the emotional needs of humans by suggesting that pets are sufficient substitutes, potentially leading to isolation or misunderstanding of human emotional needs. The meme does not contain explicit hate or abuse, but it promotes a potentially harmful oversimplification of human emotional needs and relationships.",
